msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Adaptive bitrate is the default. A manual ceiling requests your chosen Mbps from the Mac; static screens and encoder limits can lower the actual rate, and bursts may exceed it. Compression, JPEG quality and the VNC bandwidth target do not apply. Apply reconnects when changing transports, HEVC presets or the bitrate ceiling; saved logins require Windows Hello again."
msgstr "默认使用自适应码率。手动上限向 Mac 请求指定 Mbps；静止画面和编码器限制可能降低实际码率，突发流量可能超过上限。此模式不使用 VNC 压缩、JPEG 质量或带宽目标。更换传输方式、HEVC 预设或码率上限后会重新连接；已保存登录可能需要再次进行 Windows Hello 验证。"

msgctxt "ui"
