msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Apple HEVC uses encrypted control and SRTP video. Standard VNC traffic is not encrypted; use a trusted network or VPN for remote access."
msgstr "Apple HEVC 使用加密控制通道和 SRTP 视频。标准 VNC 流量不加密；远程访问请使用可信网络或 VPN。"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Apple High Performance HEVC/H.265 at up to 30 FPS. Lower stream and decoding load than 60 FPS; preserves the Mac's physical desktop. Requires Mac account login and UDP on the VNC port and the next port. A native decoder is bundled; no codec extension is needed. Apply reconnects automatically when needed. Use Clipboard for encrypted text sharing."
msgstr "Apple 高性能 HEVC/H.265，最高 30 FPS。相较 60 FPS，传输与解码负载更低，保留 Mac 物理桌面。需要使用 Mac 账户登录，并允许 VNC 端口及下一个端口的 UDP 通信。已内置原生解码器，无需安装解码扩展。应用设置时会在需要时自动重连。可使用剪贴板面板进行加密文本共享。"

