msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Default: Apple High Performance HEVC/H.265 at up to 60 FPS. Smoother motion with higher decoding and bandwidth use. Uses the same physical Mac desktop, encrypted control and SRTP video, with native decoding and software fallback. Requires a compatible Mac, Mac account login and UDP on both media ports. Apply reconnects automatically when needed."
msgstr "默认使用 Apple 高性能 HEVC/H.265，最高 60 FPS，动作更流畅，解码与带宽用量较高。使用相同 Mac 桌面、加密控制和 SRTP 视频，并提供原生解码与软件回退。需要兼容的 Mac、Mac 账户登录及两个媒体端口的 UDP；必要时应用设置会自动重连。"

