msgctxt "ui"
msgid "ZRLE: lossless compressed tiles. Sharp text and a good desktop default; more CPU than Raw. Noise and video can still use substantial bandwidth."
msgstr "ZRLE：无损图块压缩，文字清晰，适合作为桌面默认编码，CPU 占用高于 Raw。噪点和视频仍可能占用较多带宽。"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Zlib (lossless)"
msgstr "Zlib（无损）"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Zlib: lossless deflate over pixel data. Simple and broadly compatible; more CPU and usually less efficient than ZRLE or Tight."
msgstr "Zlib：对像素数据进行无损 deflate 压缩，简单且兼容性广；CPU 占用较高，通常不如 ZRLE 或 Tight 高效。"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Zoom enlarges the fitted view and may crop the edges. It does not change the Mac resolution. Actual Size maps one decoded pixel to one Windows physical pixel."
msgstr "缩放会放大适应窗口后的画面，并可能裁剪边缘，不改变 Mac 分辨率。实际大小表示一个解码像素对应一个 Windows 物理像素。"

